#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_tools.rst:78 5ee537494f124880973e63de2babbbc0
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for papers on Semantic Scholar including "
"abstracts and AI-generated TLDR summaries. This tool queries the Semantic"
" Scholar API using natural language keywords and returns papers with "
"details such as title, abstract, TLDR summary, fields of study, "
"publication year, journal (venue), and URL. Rate limits: 1 req/sec "
"without API key, 100 req/sec with SEMANTIC\\_SCHOLAR\\_API\\_KEY "
"environment variable set."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：搜索Semantic Scholar上的论文，包括摘要。该工具使用自然语言关键词查询Semantic Scholar "
"API，并返回包含标题、摘要、发表年份、期刊（出版物）和URL等详细信息的论文。"

#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_tools.rst:82 257f5d08847d4c969848e9a9dffa4c19
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for Semantic Scholar. Use "
"keywords separated by spaces to refine the search."
msgstr "``query``（字符串）（必填）用于Semantic Scholar的搜索查询。使用以空格分隔的关键词来优化搜索结果。"

#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_tools.rst:85 7dc3ea3b837943e0bb1fa8019cc46814
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of papers to return from "
"Semantic Scholar."
msgstr "``limit``（整数）（可选）从Semantic Scholar返回的论文最大数量。"

#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_tools.rst:88 9d3dca8aaea245558955f57828cde5ae
msgid ""
"``year`` (string) (optional) Filter results by publication year. Use a "
"single year (e.g., '2024') or a range (e.g., '2020-2024')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_tools.rst:91 8ee068e9b539402d86ec84bd742a0926
msgid ""
"``sort`` (string) (optional) Sort results. Options: 'citationCount:desc',"
" 'citationCount:asc', 'publicationDate:desc', 'publicationDate:asc'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_tools.rst:94 afb3646bc41944bd83ccf90121339367
msgid ""
"``include_abstract`` (boolean) (optional) If true, best-effort fetches "
"missing abstracts via the paper detail endpoint (only when abstract is "
"missing in search results)."
msgstr ""

